╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --version  -V        Show version.                                                                                                                                                                   │
│ --help               Show this message and exit.                                                                                                                                                     │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ doctor      Check Python, GPU, disk, ffmpeg, Hugging Face token and optional extras.                                                                                                                 │
│ run         Send one prompt to N-ATLaS and print the answer.                                                                                                                                         │
│ transcribe  Transcribe audio with the official N-ATLaS ASR model. Long audio is split automatically.                                                                                                 │
│ eval        Run a dataset through a model, score it, and write report.md / report.json.                                                                                                              │
│ report      Re-score a finished run (no model needed) and rewrite its report.                                                                                                                        │
│ compare     Did the candidate actually beat the base, and where did it get worse?                                                                                                                    │
│ demo        Write synthetic demo data and sample runs, to try AtlasForge with no model at all.                                                                                                       │
│ finetune    Fine-tune N-ATLaS with QLoRA and save a LoRA adapter (needs an NVIDIA GPU).                                                                                                              │
│ card        Write a licence-aware model card (attribution, 'Powered by Awarri', user cap) for an adapter.                                                                                            │
│ dataset     Dataset tools.                                                                                                                                                                           │
│ bench       Benchmark suite runners.                                                                                                                                                                 │
